# Services of overpressure's maintenance system, run by /usr/libexec/overpressure/overpressure-init
# (busybox inittab syntax; see also /usr/libexec/overpressure/svc).
# /init has already done all one-time setup before exec'ing init.
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc udhcpd
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc telnetd
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc dropbear
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc httpd
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc serial
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc usb-watch
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc recovery-watch
::respawn:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc recovery-ui
::ctrlaltdel:/sbin/reboot
::shutdown:/usr/libexec/overpressure/svc shutdown
